If I change the key, Flutter will rebuild those specific widgets but keep the other one intact. But there's a subtlety - when we use `_pages[_selectedIndex]`, changing the key won't automatically re-run initState for that page unless the widget constructor receives the new key and it becomes part of the Widget's identity.

